#
# ==========================================================================
# EXPANDED SET beyond the Christian/Western core: movable non-Gregorian
# feasts (Islamic/Jewish/Chinese/Persian/Hindu/Buddhist), the Orthodox-Easter
# cycle, secular fixed days, and the jurisdiction-bound tier (mother's/father's
# day). Dates come from the engine's tabulated calendars (Umm al-Qura,
# arithmetic Hebrew, tabulated Chinese, arithmetic Solar Hijri) or, where no
# closed form is modelled (Diwali, Vesak), from decree tables in WELL_KNOWN.
# Native-script surfaces for Arabic/Hebrew carry their own orthography.
# ==========================================================================
#
# ===== English =====
orthodox_easter    | en | orthodox easter ;; greek easter
orthodox_good_friday | en | orthodox good friday
orthodox_easter_monday | en | orthodox easter monday
orthodox_christmas | en | orthodox christmas ;; russian christmas
orthodox_christmas_eve | en | orthodox christmas eve
eid_al_fitr        | en | eid ;; eid al-fitr ;; eid ul-fitr ;; id al-fitr
eid_al_adha        | en | eid al-adha ;; eid ul-adha ;; bakrid
ramadan            | en | ramadan ;; start of ramadan
islamic_new_year   | en | islamic new year ;; hijri new year
ashura             | en | ashura ;; ashoura
mawlid             | en | mawlid ;; milad un nabi ;; prophet's birthday
rosh_hashanah      | en | rosh hashanah ;; rosh hashana
yom_kippur         | en | yom kippur ;; day of atonement
passover           | en | passover ;; pesach
hanukkah           | en | hanukkah ;; chanukah ;; hannukah
chinese_new_year   | en | chinese new year ;; lunar new year ;; spring festival
mid_autumn         | en | mid-autumn festival ;; mid autumn festival ;; mooncake festival
nowruz             | en | nowruz ;; norouz ;; persian new year
diwali             | en | diwali ;; deepavali
vesak              | en | vesak ;; buddha's birthday ;; wesak
halloween          | en | halloween
valentines         | en | valentine's day ;; valentines day ;; saint valentine's day
st_patricks        | en | saint patrick's day ;; st patrick's day ;; st patricks day ;; st paddy's day
thanksgiving       | en | thanksgiving ;; thanksgiving day
mothers_day        | en | mother's day ;; mothers day
fathers_day        | en | father's day ;; fathers day
