#
# ==========================================================================
# NATIONAL / CIVIL fixed-date holidays (es / fr / it / pt / en). Spoken
# surfaces for the WELL_KNOWN national/civil entries. Multi-word names bind as
# one holiday and win longest-match over the bare month/"day"/weekday tokens
# they embed. NOTE en "labour_day" carries ONLY "may day" / "international
# workers' day": the U.S. "Labor Day" is the 1st Monday of September, a
# different rule, so it is deliberately NOT offered as a 1-May surface.
# ==========================================================================
#
# ===== Spanish =====
labour_day               | es | día del trabajador ;; día del trabajo ;; primero de mayo
immaculate_conception    | es | inmaculada concepción ;; la inmaculada ;; día de la inmaculada
hispanic_day             | es | fiesta nacional ;; día de la hispanidad ;; fiesta nacional de españa
spain_constitution_day   | es | día de la constitución ;; día de la constitución española
#
# ===== French =====
labour_day               | fr | fête du travail ;; premier mai
bastille_day             | fr | fête nationale ;; quatorze juillet ;; le quatorze juillet
armistice                | fr | armistice ;; jour de l'armistice ;; le onze novembre
ve_day                   | fr | victoire 1945 ;; fête de la victoire ;; le huit mai
#
# ===== Italian =====
labour_day               | it | festa del lavoro ;; primo maggio
immaculate_conception    | it | immacolata ;; immacolata concezione
italy_liberation_day     | it | festa della liberazione ;; anniversario della liberazione
italy_republic_day       | it | festa della repubblica
#
# ===== Portuguese =====
labour_day               | pt | dia do trabalhador ;; dia do trabalho ;; primeiro de maio
immaculate_conception    | pt | imaculada conceição ;; nossa senhora da conceição
portugal_freedom_day     | pt | dia da liberdade ;; vinte e cinco de abril
portugal_day             | pt | dia de portugal ;; dia de camões
portugal_republic_day    | pt | implantação da república ;; dia da república
portugal_restoration_day | pt | restauração da independência ;; dia da restauração
#
# ===== English =====
labour_day               | en | may day ;; international workers' day
armistice                | en | armistice ;; armistice day ;; remembrance day
juneteenth               | en | juneteenth
cinco_de_mayo            | en | cinco de mayo
groundhog_day            | en | groundhog day ;; groundhog's day
earth_day                | en | earth day
all_souls                | en | all souls' day ;; all souls day
april_fools              | en | april fools' day ;; april fools day ;; april fool's day
#
# ===== National / civil holidays, round 2 (pl uk cs ru nl de sv tr fi hu da nb el ro) =====
# Spoken surfaces (incl. the inflected forms native reviewers cited) for the
# fixed-date national/civil holidays added in the round-2 sweep. Holidays that
# share a cross-border key gain only a per-locale surface here (labour_day =
# 1 May; assumption = 15 Aug; ve_day = 8 May; new_year = 1 Jan).
#
